{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>You and your sons and your father's house with you shall bear the iniquity of the sanctuary.</b> So that no impure person and no stranger enters within its partition — for this is incumbent upon all of you. And if one does enter due to a failure in your vigilance, you shall bear its iniquity." "<b>And you and your sons with you shall bear the iniquity of your priesthood.</b> Upon you alone is it to guard, so that no stranger approaches to perform priestly service."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:40:17.534162569Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}